{"name": "Sweet Home Look and Find 5 Collector's Edition", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfe1 A home that becomes yours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Sweet Home 5, you choose the place that feels right and shape it the way you like. Rooms, the yard, the porch \u2014 everything can be redesigned to match your taste and mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"388\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216450/extras/979534c773faf0b4a02eae40365f67f6.poster.avif?t=1772560897\" width=\"692\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216450/extras/979534c773faf0b4a02eae40365f67f6.webm?t=1772560897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216450/extras/979534c773faf0b4a02eae40365f67f6.mp4?t=1772560897\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd0e Hidden object fun in a warm setting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each scene holds dozens of items tucked away with care. Cozy interiors shift into green yards and peaceful outdoor spots, creating a smooth and pleasant flow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae Relaxing mini-games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you need a change of pace, short calming puzzles help unlock new features and areas, adding a steady sense of progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"388\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216450/extras/e66357f05cfd7c1c926177c7ed70ddb2.poster.avif?t=1772560897\" width=\"692\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216450/extras/e66357f05cfd7c1c926177c7ed70ddb2.webm?t=1772560897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216450/extras/e66357f05cfd7c1c926177c7ed70ddb2.mp4?t=1772560897\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddf0 Collector\u2019s Edition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 8 extra scenes<br/>\u2022 8 relaxing mini-games<br/>\u2022 8 bonus throwback levels<br/>\u2022 Wallpapers and music player<br/>\u2022 Unique apartments with exclusive furniture and d\u00e9cor</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Cozy interiors, warm scenes, pleasant object searches, and light mini-games - everything you need for a comfortable rest.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216450/a5b5e5bf4b2c1fa5482b75bb2e2a410acfb2ef69/header.jpg?t=1772560897", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Hidden Object", "Puzzle", "Casual", "Education", "Point & Click", "2D"], "developers": "Avi Games", "publishers": "Avi Games", "release_date": "Mar 3, 2026", "price": "$10.99", "appid": "4216450", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/-AuYTcQ1Z9E", "first_seen": 1771804800.0, "review_rank": 1105}